Description:
 linuxmuster-cli7 - Tools and CLI for the linuxmuster.net 7 server.
Changes:
 linuxmuster-cli7 (7.4.7) lmn74; urgency=medium
 .
   * [students] "lmncli students reset-internet" now uses
     samba_util.GroupManager instead of the deprecated LMNMgmtGroup: only
     students actually missing internet access are updated (skip is now
     explicit, not implicit), and a failure on one student no longer
     aborts silently - all failures are collected and reported at the
     end, with a non-zero exit code.
